pve-console-wall (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Datacenter -> Console Wall multi-console grid dashboard.
  * Live noVNC consoles with auto-reconnect and health-coloured borders.
  * CPU/RAM/network overlays, VM search and node/tag filtering.
  * Interactive and read-only modes; per-guest quick actions.
  * Saved layouts (server-side, per user) and auto-rotation.
  * APT hook to re-apply the UI injection after pve-manager upgrades.

